{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:58:22+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-11T16:58:22+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Austevoll Seafood ASA","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","country":"Norway","city":"Storebø","website":"https://www.auss.no","employees":7319,"summary":"Austevoll Seafood ASA, a seafood company, produces and sells salmon and trout, whitefish, and pelagic in Norway, the European Union, the United Kingdom, Eastern Europe, Africa, North America, Asia, and South America. The company owns and operates fishing vessels; aquaculture; and sells and distributes various fish species and processed fish products. It also produces white fish products, fish meals, protein concentrate, frozen pelagic, and fish oils; omega-3 oil; and canned and frozen fish products. The company was incorporated in 1981 and is based in Storebø, Norway. Austevoll Seafood ASA operates as a subsidiary of Laco AS.","exchange":"Oslo","currency":"NOK","financial_currency":"NOK","summary_fr":"Austevoll Seafood ASA, une entreprise de produits de la mer, produit et vend du saumon et de la truite, du corégone et du pélagique en Norvège, dans l'Union européenne, au Royaume-Uni, en Europe de l'Est, en Afrique, en Amérique du Nord, en Asie et en Amérique du Sud. L'entreprise possède et exploite des navires de pêche, de l'aquaculture et vend et distribue diverses espèces de poissons et produits de la pêche transformés. Il produit également des produits de poisson blanc, des farines de poisson, des concentrés de protéines, des pélagiques congelés et des huiles de poisson; huile oméga-3; et des produits de poisson en conserve et congelés."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":18184349696,"shares_outstanding":201824074,"trailing_pe":20.477272,"forward_pe":8.609257,"price_to_book":1.2151208,"ev_to_ebitda":10.74,"ev_to_revenue":1.051,"dividend_yield":0.0721,"payout_ratio":1.47